# Updater signing keys (development-plan.md section 85). The pair lives
# outside the repository — ~/.tauri/routine-launcher.key and .key.pub — and
# these patterns are the second line of defence for a copy that ends up here
# by accident. Losing the private key means shipped builds can never be
# updated again; committing it means anyone can sign an update they will accept.
*.key
*.key.pub
